---
title:    "KiCS2: A New Compiler from Curry to Haskell"
citation: "(WFLP 2011)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/WFLP11_KiCS2.html"
date:     2011-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper describes Curry implementation KiCS2 which is based on the translation of Curry programs into Haskell programs.
This implementation supports various search strategies.
The benchmarks show that it can compete with or outperform other existing implementations of Curry